st,  who to cheer up during the holidays and more to decide which cryptid you end up with.<br><br>Who do you want to laugh and cry with? Who do you want to open up to? And who do you want to share your last days of high school with?<br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Phone calls<br></li><li>Sleepovers<br></li><li>Make out sessions<br></li><li>Chill moments<br></li><li>Collectibles<br></li><li>Bonus scenes<br></li><li>Reading - accessible font Open Dyslexia<br></li><li>Multiple Endings<br></li><li>Cassette tapes<br></li><li>It's 1997, man<br></li><li>A Furry Boi<br></li><li>A Scaly Boi<br></li><li>A Fae Bae<br></li><li>A Friday the 13th Spookfest<br></li><li>A Totally X-Treme Dinosaur<br></li><li>A Vengeful Ghost<br></li><li>A really deep moment where you star-gaze and talk about feelings and stuff<br></li><li>Controller support</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Raptor Boyfriend: A High School Romance is a dating sim about a teen girl who moves to a small secret community of cryptids. Romance a magical Fairy, a sensitive Sasquatch and a bold Velociraptor. A satirical 90's teen drama about trying to find love in your last year of high school.",
