    "reviews": "\u201cRaptor Boyfriend: A High School Romance was definitely not the game I was expecting, but it was the one I needed.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 TechRaptor<br><br>\u201cRaptor Boyfriend is honestly the coming of age I wish I had had\u201d<br>Uppercut Crit<br><br>\u201c\u2026 it\u2019s a great, queer game with a great cast of characters. What\u2019s not to love about that?\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 Gayming Magazine<br>",
